The following file in the Nova source tree contains or incorporates code from
minicoro (https://github.com/edubart/minicoro) and LuaCoco/LuaJIT components:

  - compiler-codegen/nova_rt/minicoro.h

Minicoro is used for asymmetric stackful cross-platform coroutine implementation.
Parts of the assembly code are derived from LuaCoco by Mike Pall.

